WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.880
A causes B is different from B causes A

00:00:36.880 --> 00:01:17.146
Training and deployment can reward different relationships

00:01:17.146 --> 00:01:57.150
The learnt operational meaning of relevance may not travel

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:39.074
A single poor result cannot prove distribution shift

00:02:39.074 --> 00:03:21.431
Explicit term logic does not automatically bind a proposition

00:03:21.431 --> 00:04:02.358
Joint interaction creates an opportunity, not a guarantee

00:04:02.358 --> 00:04:46.804
Ask what each first stage preserves

00:04:46.804 --> 00:05:33.600
Choose the next test from the suspected loss of evidence
